, and implied meaning</li><li>Summarizing and critically reflecting on information presented in written and audio formats</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><p yackocpvbhs=\"\" 0\",=\"\" _fb_,=\"\" auto;=\"\" --cyv3zq:=\"\" 24.6939px;=\"\" --gjplxq:=\"\" 1.4;=\"\" line-height:=\"\" 34px;\"=\"\">Module 2: <b>Advanced Grammar and Sentence Structure</b></p><ul><li>Mastery of subjunctive mood (Konjunktiv II) for expressing wishes, hypothetical situations, and indirect speech</li><li>In-depth use of passive voice (Passiv) across different tenses</li><li>Complex sentence structures, including relative clauses, adverbial clauses, and advanced conjunctions</li><li>Nuanced use of word order and focus within sentences</li><li>Advanced use of modal verbs, conditional sentences, and reported speech</li></ul></td><td><p yackocpvbhs=\"\" 0\",=\"\" _fb_,=\"\" auto;=\"\" --cyv3zq:=\"\" 24.6939px;=\"\" --gjplxq:=\"\" 1.4;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.01em;=\"\" line-height:=\"\" 34px;\"=\"\">Module 5: <b>Writing Skills</b></p><ul><li>Writing formal and informal letters, emails, and reports with proper structure and style</li><li>Composing argumentative essays, research papers, and opinion articles</li><li>Developing skills to analyze, evaluate, and critique different viewpoints in writing</li><li>Refining editing and proofreading techniques for error-free, coherent writing</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><p yackocpvbhs=\"\" 0\",=\"\" _fb_,=\"\" auto;=\"\" --cyv3zq:=\"\" 24.6939px;=\"\" --gjplxq:=\"\" 1.4;=\"\" line-height:=\"\" 34px;\"=\"\">Module 3: <b>Advanced Communication Skills</b></p><ul><li>Participating in debates and discussions on controversial topics</li><li>Expressing and justifying personal opinions with clarity and persuasion</li><li>Presenting detailed arguments, analyzing different perspectives, and summarizing viewpoints</li><li>Engaging in professional and academic conversations, including presentations and interviews</li><li>Building skills for negotiation, persuasion, and problem-solving in German</li></ul></td><td><p yackocpvbhs=\"\" 0\",=\"\" _fb_,=\"\" auto;=\"\" --cyv3zq:=\"\" 24.6939px;=\"\" --gjplxq:=\"\" 1.4;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.01em;=\"\" line-height:=\"\" 34px;\"=\"\">Module 6: <b>Cultural Understanding and Contextual Language Use</b></p><ul><li>Exploring German history, literature, and art in more detail</li><li>Understanding cultural differences and practices in German-speaking countries</li><li>Analyzing media, films, and literary works for deeper cultural insights</li><li>Examining current social, political, and environmental issues in Germany and the German-speaking world</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p yackocpvbhs=\"\" 0\",=\"\" _fb_,=\"\" auto;=\"\" --cyv3zq:=\"\" 24.6939px;=\"\" --gjplxq:=\"\" 1.4;=\"\" line-height:=\"\" 34px;\"=\"\">Assessment and Certification:</p><ul><li>Continuous evaluations through assignments, quizzes, and discussions</li><li>Final exam to assess proficiency at the B2 level, including speaking, listening, reading, and writing skills</li><li>B2 level certification upon successful completion</li></ul><p yackocpvbhs=\"\" 0\",=\"\" _fb_,=\"\" auto;=\"\" --cyv3zq:=\"\" 12px;=\"\" --gjplxq:=\"\" 1.4;=\"\" line-height:=\"\" 16px;\"=\"\"></p><p yackocpvbhs=\"\" 0\",=\"\" _fb_,=\"\" auto;=\"\" --cyv3zq:=\"\" 24.6939px;=\"\" --gjplxq:=\"\" 1.4;=\"\" line-height:=\"\" 34px;\"=\"\">This course is designed for learners who are already confident in their German language skills and wish to refine their fluency. The focus is on sophisticated language use, critical thinking, and practical application in both professional and social contexts.</p><h3>Materials & Methodology</h3><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Course & Work Book</td><td>Notes of LangNation</td><td>German Stories</td><td>Mock tests</td></tr><tr><td>Live Sessions</td><td>Individual tasks</td><td>Exams Preparation</td><td>Quizzes</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>Extra</h3><h3><ul><li>B2 Exams Preparation</li><li>S