(21,'german-weekend-a1','de','German Weekend A1','Weekend','A1','Beginner','German Courses','01112041','8 Weeks','16 Each 180 Min',10,5,200.00,NULL,NULL,0,'Der A1-Lehrplan samstags und sonntags — für Berufstätige. Gleicher Lehrplan, gleiches Zertifikat, ohne Termine unter der Woche.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p>German Language Level A1 certificate is recognized by the German embassies as the proof of the basic knowledge of German. This enables you to apply for a visa for the subsequent immigration of your spouse.</p><p>German Language Level A1 is also the lowest level of proficiency according to the Common European Framework of Reference for Languages. </p><h3><b>At a Glance</b></h3><ul><li>Thereof 10 hours a week independent learning (tutored)</li><li>Flexible timing and from any location</li><li>Learn independently (tutored)</li><li>Individual mentoring from your tutor</li><li>Exercises with plenty of variety</li><li>Interesting and up-to-date topics</li><li>Free online placement test</li><li>Maximum number of participants: 6</li></ul><p><br></p><div><p><br></p></div>','<h3><b>Course Contents</b></h3><ul><li>Alphabet & Number system</li><li>Article, Noun, and Pronouns</li><li>Case system</li><li>Prepositions</li><li>Adjectives</li><li>Basic Noun, verbs and Adj/adv (around 500)</li><li>Sentence structure</li><li>The modal verb in the present tense</li><li>Separable and inseparable verbs</li><li>Basic translations</li><li>German basic verbs (around 150)</li><li>Plural</li><li>Etc.</li></ul><h3><b>Training Methodology</b></h3><ul><li>Independent study with virtual material</li><li>Live Sessions in a group</li><li>Lectures from our LangNation experts</li><li>Audio and Video assistance</li><li>Combination of classroom and online teaching</li><li>Classroom discussions, group discussion</li><li>Individual tasks and group tasks</li></ul><h3><b>Materials Included</b></h3><ul><li>Begegnungen A1 Kurs und Arbeitbuch</li><li>Notes of LangNation</li><li>3-5 German Stories</li><li>10 Mock tests</li></ul>','<h3><b>Placement Test/ Einstufungstest</b></h3><div>The placement test is <b>not required</b> for the A1 level.</div><div><br></div><h3><b>Technical requirements for the online course</b></h3><ul><li>PC, laptop or tablet</li><li>Headset with microphone</li><li>Stable internet connection</li><li>Email address</li><li>Operating system: Windows, macOS, Android, iOS</li><li>Browser: Current version of Google Chrome (for all operating systems)</li></ul>','<p>Please click one of the following links, for which you want to see the exam, and then go to the Exam Pattern section.</p><div><h3><a href=\"/downloads/Mix/Exam%20Pattern/Telc/Telc%20A1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Telc Exam Pattern </a><a href=\"/downloads/Mix/Exam%20Pattern/Telc/Telc%20A1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>Click Here</u></a></h3><h3>Goethe Exam Pattern <a href=\"/courses\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>Click Here</u></a></h3></div>','A1 German Language Certificate | German Weekend A1 | Langnation.com','Langnation.com is the best online German School to learn German Weekend A1 with highly valued digital certificate with a unique ID at the end of each course. Contact us : Phone: +49 176 55241842 | WhatsApp: +91 8375939748 | Email: info@langnation.com','German Weekend A1','German-Weekend-A1','archived',0,6,'2026-09-09 06:27:19',NULL),
