(23,'german-weekend-b1','de','German Weekend B1','Weekend','B1','Intermediate','German Courses','08082043','10 Weeks','20 Each 180 Min',10,6,300.00,NULL,NULL,0,'B1 am Wochenende, über zehn Wochen. Erreichen Sie das für Visum und Ausbildung geforderte Niveau, ohne sich freinehmen zu müssen.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p>Language level B1 is the third level of proficiency according to the Common European Framework of Reference for Languages. The aim of this learning stage is the ability to speak.<br></p><p>You should have B1 level knowledge in order to get by in daily activities in Germany. \"Goethe Zertifikat Deutsch / Telc Deutsch B1\" is recognized as the proof of the language required for applying for German citizenship.</p><h3><b>At a Glance</b></h3><ul><li>Thereof 10 hours a week independent learning (tutored)</li><li>Flexible timing and from any location</li><li>Learn independently (tutored)</li><li>Individual mentoring from your tutor</li><li>Exercises with plenty of variety</li><li>Interesting and up-to-date topics</li><li>Free online placement test</li><li>Maximum number of participants: 6</li></ul><div><br></div>','<h3><b>Course Contents</b></h3><ul><li>Types of Verbs</li><li>German Pronouns: personal, possessive, demonstrative, reflexive, relative, demonstrative, Interrogative and Indefinite.</li><li>Verb ”lassen”</li><li>Types of sentences: Hausptsatz and Nebensatz</li><li>Connectors with Nebensatz</li><li>Types of Prepositions: modal, temporal, kausal and lokal</li><li>Adjectives: Komporativ and Superlativ</li><li>K2</li><li>K1</li><li>Pronoun Adverbs</li><li>Relative sentences</li><li>Past participle</li><li>Declension of Adjectives without articles</li><li>Active and passive voices</li><li>Advanced connectors</li><li>New German Verbs (around 600)</li><li>Advanced Sentence structure</li><li>zu + infinitive verb and um zu + infinite verb</li></ul><h3><b>Training Methodology</b></h3><ul><li>Independent study with virtual material</li><li>Live Sessions in a group</li><li>Lectures from our LangNation experts</li><li>Audio and Video assistance</li><li>Combination of classroom and online teaching</li><li>Classroom discussions, group discussion</li><li>Individual tasks and group tasks</li></ul><div><br></div><h3><b>Materials Included</b></h3><ul><li>Begegnungen B1 Kurs und Arbeitbuch</li><li>Notes of LangNation</li><li>5 German Stories</li><li>10 Mock tests</li></ul>','<h3><b>Placement Test/ Einstufungstest</b></h3><div>A placement test is required for the B1 level.</div><div><br></div><h3><b>Technical requirements for the online course</b></h3><ul><li>PC, laptop or tablet</li><li>Headset with microphone</li><li>Stable internet connection</li><li>Email address</li><li>Operating system: Windows, macOS, Android, iOS</li><li>Browser: Current version of Google Chrome (for all operating systems)</li></ul>','<p>Please click one of the following links, for which you want to see the exam, and then go to the Exam Pattern section.</p><div><h3><a href=\"/downloads/Mix/Exam%20Pattern/Telc/Telc%20B1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Telc Exam Pattern </a><a href=\"/downloads/Mix/Exam%20Pattern/Telc/Telc%20B1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>Click Here</u></a></h3><h3>Goethe Exam Pattern <a href=\"/courses\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>Click Here</u></a></h3></div>','German Weekend B1 | Langnation.com','Langnation.com is the best online German School to learn German Weekend B1 with highly valued digital certificate with a unique ID at the end of each course. Contact us : Phone: +49 176 55241842 | WhatsApp: +91 8375939748 | Email: info@langnation.com','German Weekend B1','German-Weekend-B1','archived',0,8,'2026-09-09 06:27:19',NULL),
