ble internet connection</li><li>Email address</li><li>Operating system: Windows, macOS, Android, iOS</li><li>Browser: Current version of Google Chrome (for all operating systems)</li></ul>','<p>Please click one of the following links, for which you want to see the exam, and then go to the Exam Pattern section.</p><h3><a href=\"/downloads/Mix/Exam%20Pattern/Telc/Telc%20B1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Telc Exam Pattern</a><a href=\"/downloads/Mix/Exam%20Pattern/Telc/Telc%20B1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Telc B1</a><a href=\"/downloads/Mix/Exam%20Pattern/Telc/Telc%20B1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View / Download</a></h3><h3>Goethe Exam Pattern <a href=\"/courses\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>Click Here</u></a></h3>','German Speaking Course B1 & B2 | LangNation',NULL,NULL,'German-Speaking-Course-B1-B2','archived',0,9,'2026-09-09 06:27:19',NULL),
